(1,528 observations deleted)

.         drop tag1

. 
. 
. * GENERATE VARIABLES * (Please adapt according to your needs)
.         * generate dummy variable for whether participant has at least one da
> ughter (1) or not (0)
.         gen d_daughter = (kidsex01==2|kidsex02==2|kidsex03==2|kidsex04==2|kid
> sex05==2|kidsex06==2|kidsex07==2|kidsex08==2|kidsex09==2|kidsex10==2|kidsex11
> ==2|kidsex12==2|kidsex13==2|kidsex14==2|kidsex15==2|kidsex16==2|kidsex17==2|k
> idsex18==2|kidsex19==2)

. 
. 
.         *generate weekly childcare hours
.         gen childcare_sat=pli0019_v4 if pli0019_v4>=0
(174,666 missing values generated)

.         gen childcare_sun=pli0022_v4 if pli0022_v4>=0
(174,749 missing values generated)

.         gen childcare_weekday=pli0044_v3 if pli0044_v3>=0
(16,052 missing values generated)

.         gen weekly_childcare=childcare_sat+childcare_sun+childcare_weekday
(175,099 missing values generated)

. 
.         gen male_childcare=weekly_childcare if sex==1
(245,294 missing values generated)

.         gen female_childcare=weekly_childcare if sex==2
(245,139 missing values generated)

. 
.         *generate control variables
.         *male DV
.         gen male=sex==1

.         *age=survey year-birth year
.         gen age=syear-gebjahr

.         *immigrant status DV =1 if born overseas, 0 if born in germany or imm
> ig <1950
.         gen immig_status=germborn==2

.         *log net household income
.         gen log_income=log(hghinc)
(15,070 missing values generated)

.         *total number of years of education
.         gen edu=pgbilzeit

. 
.         *generate household level variables
.         bys syear hid: egen h_male_childcare=max(male_childcare)
(175,254 missing values generated)

.         bys syear hid: egen h_female_childcare=max(female_childcare)
(174,944 missing values generated)

.         gen disparity=h_female_childcare-h_male_childcare
(178,538 missing values generated)

.         bys syear hid: egen h_daughter=max(d_daughter)

.         bys syear hid: egen h_ave_age=mean(age)

.         bys syear hid: egen h_immig=sum(germborn)

.         bys syear hid: egen h_ave_edu=mean(edu) if edu>=0
(4,225 missing values generated)

. 
.         *tag and drop households with missing observables for 1 partner
.         duplicates tag syear hid h_daughter disparity h_ave_age h_ave_edu h_i
> mmig log_income, gen(tag)

Duplicates in terms of syear hid h_daughter disparity h_ave_age h_ave_edu
    h_immig log_income

.         drop if tag==0
(7,150 observations deleted)

.         drop tag

. 
.         sort hid syear pid

. 
.         duplicates drop syear hid h_daughter disparity h_ave_age h_ave_edu h_
> immig log_income, force

Duplicates in terms of syear hid h_daughter disparity h_ave_age h_ave_edu
    h_immig log_income

(154,092 observations deleted)

