. * HYPOTHESIS TEST FOR H3 * (Please adapt according to your needs)
. 
.         * Please add a verbal description of your model here
. 
.         * Using gender disparity in weekly childcare hours as measure of hous
> ehold gender equality
.         * Accordingly, we run a linear OLS regression analysis with disparity
>  as dependent variable and the dummy variable d_daughter as independent varia
> ble
. 
. 
.         reg disparity h_daughter $controls i.syear, r

